A second-round poll by "Biuro Badan Społecznych 'Wika'" for "Fundacja Radia 'Solidarność'" among 500 respondents showed that 68% would vote for Wałęsa, and 14% for Tymiński in the city of [[Warsaw]].<ref>{{cite news |date={{date|1990-12-06|DMY}} |title=WAŁĘSA - 68 TYMIŃSKI - 14 |url=https://classic.wyborcza.pl/archiwumGW/6044147/WALESA---68-TYMINSKI---14 |publisher=[[Gazeta Wyborcza]] |access-date=2025-09-28}}</ref>

